  "_dataSaverComment": "Only blocked when Settings > Data Saver Mode is on -- separate from ad-blocking above (always on). None of these are ads; they're YouTube's own telemetry, prefetch, and hover-preview requests that don't affect whether a video plays or which video it is, only YouTube's own analytics/UX-polish signals. Safe to drop when the goal is saving data/battery, but distinct from ad-blocking's 'never load this, it's an ad' logic.",
